My last review was positive and said this;
I enjoy playing TF2 because the updates are never minor bug fixes or stability things they're always buffs and nerfs and additions that make the game more interesting. Its a fast paced game that is very objective based and just as the name suggests its oreiented on teamwork. The one negetive is due to its team oriented gameplay pubs are very hard as there is little to no communication with team mates. That being said some playstyles don't require team mates as much and can be enjoyable on pubs and at a competetive level.
I completely retract this after the Meet Your Match update, custom HUDs don't work and they removed pubs. They replaced them with a pathetic casual play that takes two hours to find a game and bans you if you leave so you have to play the game you're in. If all that wasn't enough, you now need to put in two options for game modes so you can't garuntee that you will get the mode you want. I do not recommend this and until Valve fixes this, my review is very negative

