Good Things about Team Fortress 2:
-Many types of gamemodes (Payload, King of the Hill, Attack/Defense, MvM...);
-Cosmetics (obviosly);
-Crazy and cool weapons;
-Dedicated Community;
-Characters with great personality;
-Free to play
Bad Things about Team Fortress 2:
-Unbalanced teams;
-A lack of updates;
-Broken updates;
-Competitive mode is more or less good;
-ValvE doesn't seem to care
The game was considerd a GREAT game in his prime time. But the lack of of comunication, manpower (as the developer team is comprised of only 5 people, more or less) and the fact that  ValvE just doens't seem to be the Company that we all thought to be.
Feel free to take whatever you want from this review be it the good or the bad.

